### ========================================
### USUARIOS - /api/users
### Solo accesible con rol ADMIN
### Reemplaza <TOKEN> con el token de un usuario ADMIN
### ========================================

### Listar todos los usuarios
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Obtener usuario por ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Actualizar rol de usuario (roles: USER, ADMIN, WAREHOUSE)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/users/1/role
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

{
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### Activar usuario
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/users/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

{
  "active": true
}

### Desactivar usuario
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/users/2/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

{
  "active": false
}

### Eliminar usuario
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/users/2
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
